  "alternateName": "Litter composition, amount and spatial distribution below harmful levels in coastal and marine environment",
  "description": "The composition, amount and spatial distribution of litter on the coastline, in the surface layer of the water column, and on the seabed, are at levels that do not cause harm to the coastal and marine environment. Member States shall establish threshold values for these levels through cooperation at Union level, taking into account regional or subregional specificities.",
